{"CFDocument":{"identifier":"0ef60b38-9109-11e9-9ab3-ef46d22b49d8","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/0ef60b38-9109-11e9-9ab3-ef46d22b49d8","creator":"IEEE","title":"Normalized Data Schema","lastChangeDateTime":"2019-06-17T18:09:57+00:00","adoptionStatus":"Adopted"},"CFItems":[{"identifier":"83eac29e-9109-11e9-bac4-6d3b100e53e1","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/83eac29e-9109-11e9-bac4-6d3b100e53e1","fullStatement":"People","humanCodingScheme":"1.0","notes":"People are human beings, alive or deceased, as recognized by each country's legal definitions.  In tmost  countries, \"people\" have rights to secure personally identifiable information (PII), rights to access information about them, and rights to control who else has access to education records about them (see Privacy, Access, and Control Framework).","lastChangeDateTime":"2019-06-17T14:29:38+00:00"},{"identifier":"4a653fd4-910b-11e9-a800-21a386e53ae8","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/4a653fd4-910b-11e9-a800-21a386e53ae8","fullStatement":"Role","humanCodingScheme":"2.0","notes":"People have roles in Organizations for specific periods of time.","lastChangeDateTime":"2019-06-17T14:22:09+00:00"},{"identifier":"75aac29a-910b-11e9-b585-afa989e1addc","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/75aac29a-910b-11e9-b585-afa989e1addc","fullStatement":"Organizations","humanCodingScheme":"3.0","notes":"Organizations are groups of one or more People.  Organizations do not have the same rights to secure PII and access as People.","lastChangeDateTime":"2019-06-17T14:23:21+00:00"},{"identifier":"7b5861b0-910c-11e9-889e-2302618a65cb","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/7b5861b0-910c-11e9-889e-2302618a65cb","fullStatement":"Learning Event","humanCodingScheme":"4.0","notes":"People and Organizations have learning events with each other and with Resources on or over specific periods of time.","lastChangeDateTime":"2019-06-17T14:30:40+00:00"},{"identifier":"a15f2b6e-910c-11e9-b836-ebfb4532b374","uri":"https://opensalt.net/uri/a15f2b6e-910c-11e9-b836-ebf